{"t": 1794510175.122, "kind": "output", "output": "/var/www/larkspur/wp-content/uploads/forminator/15_c1924ee2c414ac1fd30a28521b931830/index.php\n/var/www/larkspur/wp-content/uploads/forminator/15_c1924ee2c414ac1fd30a28521b931830/css/index.php\n      7 108.44.89.229 \"POST /wp-content/plugins/larkspur-site/inc/booking.php 200 \"Mozilla/5.0\n      5 96.255.179.178 \"POST /wp-content/plugins/larkspur-site/inc/booking.php 200 \"Mozilla/5.0\n      5 20.42.225.134 \"POST /wp-content/plugins/larkspur-site/inc/booking.php 200 \"Mozilla/5.0\n      4 68.36.126.212 \"POST /wp-content/plugins/larkspur-site/inc/booking.php 200 \"Mozilla/5.0\n      3 73.162.101.89 \"POST /wp-content/plugins/larkspur-site/inc/booking.php 200 \"Mozilla/5.0\n\n#!/bin/sh\n# Payout reconciliation. The payment key here must be the key the billing database has, or the gateway\n# refuses the payout batch; the job says so when they differ, which is what a half-finished key rotation\n# looks like. Open invoices are counted for the Friday payout.\nset -u\nCFG=/etc/larkspur/payments.ini\nstamp=$(date -Is)\nval() { sed -n \"s/^$1 *= *//p\" \"$CFG\" 2>/dev/null | head -1; }\nKEY=$(val secret_key); DBH=$(val db_host); DBN=$(val db_name); DBU=$(val db_user); DBP=$(val db_password)\nif [ -z \"$KEY\" ] || [ -z \"$DBH\" ]; then\n    echo \"$stamp payouts fail cannot read $CFG\"\n    exit 1\nfi\nMYSQL_PWD=\"$DBP\" export MYSQL_PWD\nrow=$(mysql -h \"$DBH\" -u \"$DBU\" -N -B -e \\\n    \"select secret_key from payment_providers where provider='stripe'\" \"$DBN\" 2>&1) || {\n    echo \"$stamp payouts fail billing database: $(echo \"$row\" | tail -1 | cut -c1-120)\"\n    exit 1\n}\nif [ \"$row\" != \"$KEY\" ]; then\n    echo \"$stamp payouts fail the key in $CFG is not the key in $DBN.payment_providers\"\n    exit 1\nfi\nopen=$(mysql -h \"$DBH\" -u \"$DBU\" -N -B -e \"select count(*) from invoices where paid_at is null\" \"$DBN\" 2>/dev/null)\necho \"$stamp payouts ok ${open:-0} open invoices\"\n/opt/larkspur/bin:\ntotal 6656\ndrwxr-xr-x 1 root root      60 Feb 17  2026 .\ndrwxr-xr-x 1 root root      60 Feb 17  2026 ..\n-rwxr-xr-x 1 root root 6809944 Feb 17  2026 python3\n-rwxr-xr-x 1 root root    2043 Feb 17  2026 stock-sync\n\n/usr/local/bin:\ntotal 6892\ndrwxr-xr-x 1 root root      60 Nov  3 13:54 .\ndrwxr-xr-x 1 root root     100 Oct 30 22:58 ..\n-rwxr-xr-x 1 root root     536 Oct 30 19:45 larkspur-deploy\n-rwxr-xr-x 1 root root     366 Mar  5  2026 larkspur-restart\n-rwxr-xr-x 1 root root 7048108 Nov  3 13:54 wp\n\n/usr/local/sbin:\ntotal 44\ndrwxr-xr-x 1 root root   120 Nov 12 18:57 .\ndrwxr-xr-x 1 root root   100 Oct 30 22:58 ..\n-rwxr-xr-x 1 root root  2291 Oct  1 13:27 larkspur-mailing-export\n-rwxr-xr-x 1 root root   931 Oct 30 19:45 larkspur-metrics\n-rwxr-xr-x 1 root root  1510 Oct 30 22:58 larkspur-orders\n-rwxr-xr-x 1 root root  1173 Oct 30 22:58 larkspur-payouts\n-rwxr-xr-x 1 root root   622 Oct 30 19:45 larkspur-report\n-rwxr-xr-x 1 root root   828 Nov  3 13:54 note\n-rwxr-xr-x 1 root root   402 Oct 30 22:58 offsite-backup\n-rwxr-xr-x 1 root root 13438 Nov  3 13:54 rotate-secret\n[exit 0]\n", "host": "web-01"}
